00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:04.679
Dividend income screening is the decision to own Canadian stocks with sustainable monthly

00:02:04.679 --> 00:02:10.979
payouts that can compound inside a tax-free savings account, or TFSA, without immediate tax

00:02:10.979 --> 00:02:11.319
drag.

00:02:11.899 --> 00:02:18.379
Full Canada sets the filter at yields above 5%, payout ratios below 70% of free cash flow,

00:02:18.799 --> 00:02:21.159
and at least 5 years of consecutive increases.

00:02:21.159 --> 00:02:27.119
Think of that 70% payout cap like a household that only spends 70 cents of every dollar it

00:02:27.119 --> 00:02:30.479
brings home, so a rough month does not bounce the rent check.

00:02:31.373 --> 00:02:37.073
Pado Exploration and Development is the name that clears those screens, with a 5.7% forward

00:02:37.073 --> 00:02:39.093
yield and 12% monthly dividends.

00:02:39.533 --> 00:02:44.593
The company has delivered 27 year average returns on equity of 24%.

00:02:44.593 --> 00:02:50.933
Average returns on capital employed ran 17% over the same stretch, from operations concentrated

00:02:50.933 --> 00:02:57.553
in Alberta's Deep Basin with long-life reserves, low-cost operations, and disciplined capital allocation.

00:02:58.033 --> 00:03:03.273
It has returned about $3.5 billion in dividends to shareholders since 1998.

00:03:03.913 --> 00:03:13.633
The 2026 capital plan is $450 million to $550 million, focused on drilling 70-80 net wells and expanding gathering infrastructure.

00:03:13.633 --> 00:03:20.013
You open the TSX screener in WealthSimple or Questrade, sort by monthly frequency and yield,

00:03:20.453 --> 00:03:25.793
then read the latest quarterly cashflow statement for coverage before allocating $20,000 split

00:03:25.793 --> 00:03:30.133
equally with a second name such as Automotive Properties Real Estate Investment Trust,

00:03:30.493 --> 00:03:34.613
or REIT to target more than $200 in combined monthly income.

00:03:35.233 --> 00:03:39.613
I have no financial relationship with WealthSimple, Questrade, or Unusual Wales.

00:03:39.613 --> 00:03:44.933
The approach worked in 2022 when energy names maintained payouts while broader markets

00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:45.233
fell.

00:03:45.733 --> 00:03:49.733
It fails when commodity prices collapse faster than cost cuts can offset.

00:03:50.433 --> 00:03:55.853
Payto Exploration and Development, ticker PEY on the TSX, is today's simulated weekly

00:03:55.853 --> 00:04:00.713
hold, and it demonstrates dividend income screening by taking a name the screen already

00:04:00.713 --> 00:04:03.693
qualified and putting a five-session clock on it.

00:04:04.093 --> 00:04:09.393
This is a simulated trade for learning purposes, with a $1,000 national position and

00:04:09.393 --> 00:04:14.473
no real money at risk. It enters at Monday's open under the published rules and is judged

00:04:14.473 --> 00:04:21.033
against the NASDAQ over those five sessions. The entry we are marking is $12.42 Canadian,

00:04:21.513 --> 00:04:27.199
sitting above the 50-session average. Volume confirmation is absent on recent sessions,

00:04:27.559 --> 00:04:33.779
so that factor is not part of the thesis. An 8% stop below entry caps the loss at $80 on

00:04:33.779 --> 00:04:36.679
the $1,000 position if it is breached interday.

00:04:37.239 --> 00:04:42.219
The target is plus 2% to plus 4% over 5 sessions if yield support holds.

00:04:42.759 --> 00:04:43.799
Confidence is medium.

00:04:44.299 --> 00:04:48.639
The yield and cash flow history align, but sector rotation signals remain mixed.

00:04:49.279 --> 00:04:54.179
The thesis is wrong if the next monthly production update shows a sequential volume decline of

00:04:54.179 --> 00:04:55.539
more than 5%.

00:04:55.839 --> 00:05:00.679
The micron hold carried medium confidence with mixed sector signals and still cleared the

00:05:00.679 --> 00:05:05.879
index because the earning surprise history held, so mixed rotation is why Payto stays medium

00:05:05.879 --> 00:05:10.539
rather than an automatic pass, and why that stop is entered before Monday's open.

00:05:11.239 --> 00:05:13.539
Dividend compounding is the family under test.

00:05:14.039 --> 00:05:17.559
Valuation discipline is the habit that kept the prior entry from chasing.

00:05:18.672 --> 00:05:21.632
Micron, ticker MU, was the earlier weekly hold.

00:05:22.092 --> 00:05:25.932
A valuation entry ahead of earnings with a positive earning surprise history.

00:05:25.932 --> 00:05:33.572
We simulated buying it at the Thursday open at $879.66 US and exiting at the Wednesday

00:05:33.572 --> 00:05:36.452
close at $983.23.

00:05:36.932 --> 00:05:45.832
Held five sessions, the position gained 11.77% or $117.74 on the $1,000 stake.

00:05:46.372 --> 00:05:54.192
The NASDAQ gained 0.92% over the same sessions, so the matched window alpha was plus 10.85%.

00:05:54.192 --> 00:05:58.892
stated confidence was medium. The stated invalidation was a next earnings report

00:05:58.892 --> 00:06:04.492
missing consensus by more than 5% and that never mattered. The 8% stop below

00:06:04.492 --> 00:06:08.992
entry was not reached. The medium grade fit those mixed sector signals and the

00:06:08.992 --> 00:06:13.923
earning surprise history is what the tape actually paid. Unusual Wales options

00:06:13.923 --> 00:06:18.483
flow surfaces dark pool and options block trades in real time so you can see

00:06:18.483 --> 00:06:22.283
where large players are positioning ahead of events such as a federal open market

00:06:22.283 --> 00:06:28.443
committee or FOMC decision. It flags unusual call or put activity on names you already

00:06:28.443 --> 00:06:33.483
follow rather than waiting for after the fact headlines. Access starts at the free tier

00:06:33.483 --> 00:06:39.843
with paid API tokens available for automated alerts. The concrete step on a rate week is to set

00:06:39.843 --> 00:06:44.823
those alerts on the rate sensitive names you already hold, then read whether the block prints are

00:06:44.823 --> 00:06:50.343
stacking on the call side or the put side before the next session. That is positioning data, not a

00:06:50.343 --> 00:06:53.403
forecast, and it does not replace the cash flow coverage

00:06:53.403 --> 00:06:55.603
checked the dividend screen already required.

