00:08:57.302 --> 00:09:01.162
and no discretionary exits are the rules a listener can reproduce from the pick,

00:09:01.162 --> 00:09:02.782
panic, the date, and the stop.

00:09:03.342 --> 00:09:06.742
Dividend underscore income is the family those rules test next.

00:09:07.302 --> 00:09:12.742
You bought Celestica at the open after an 8% rebound on AI news, and you parked a mental

00:09:12.742 --> 00:09:16.922
10% stop because the stock had already dropped 12% the prior session.

00:09:17.602 --> 00:09:21.222
Do you leave that stop in your head or do you put it on the book before the next tape?

00:09:21.822 --> 00:09:23.242
Here is how I would think about it.

00:09:23.482 --> 00:09:27.642
A hard stop triggers on the exchange book, a mental stop waits for your next login.

00:09:27.642 --> 00:09:34.002
During a 37% monthly drawdown, the bid asked spread wide into 40 cents while volume spiked

00:09:34.002 --> 00:09:39.702
above the 20-day average, so a hard stop at $152 would have filled near the low while

00:09:39.702 --> 00:09:42.202
a mental stop left you exposed to the next gap.

00:09:42.982 --> 00:09:47.642
The bounce that followed came after third quarter numbers and a hiked sales outlook, which

00:09:47.642 --> 00:09:51.702
is exactly when a mental stop feels clever in hindsight and sloppy in the gap.

00:09:51.702 --> 00:09:56.722
app. Set the stop at the most recent swing low on the daily chart plus one average true

00:09:56.722 --> 00:10:02.142
range. Then enter it as a stop limit order with a 2% buffer so slippage does not turn

00:10:02.142 --> 00:10:07.982
a 10% risk into 13%. The misconception is treating the stop as a prediction that the

00:10:07.982 --> 00:10:12.862
thesis is broken rather than a pre-committed exit that removes emotion once the position

00:10:12.862 --> 00:10:19.203
is live. A stop that is not on the book is just a hope. Open your brokerage screener, filter

00:10:19.203 --> 00:10:25.903
the TSX for monthly payers above 5% yield with payout ratios below 70%, and write down

00:10:25.903 --> 00:10:29.223
the three names that also sit above their 50-session average close.

